{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "terminator",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 52,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Start",
      "shape_type": "normal",
      "fill_color": "#e0e0e0",
      "details": "Instruction Title for AI\n-Part Number Assignment System\nDetailed Specifications\n- The system shall support the issuance and discontinuation of part numbers, management of part-number-related information, and attribute-based searches.\n- Part numbers shall consist of 12 characters and use the following format:\nPart Type (4 characters) - Feature/Material (4 characters) - Sequential Number (4 characters)\nExample: ABCD-XX10-0001\nThe part number shall use a meaningful (intelligent) numbering scheme in which each segment represents specific information.\n- Part information shall be stored and managed using a DBMS, and all operation histories shall be recorded.",
      "note": {
        "dx": -450,
        "dy": 30,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 112,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "User Login",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Input: User ID and password\n- Authenticate against the user master in the DBMS\n- Roles: Administrator (all operations), Registrar (issue, update, discontinue), Viewer (search only)\n- Lock the account after 5 consecutive failed attempts",
      "note": {
        "dx": -195,
        "dy": 30,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 172,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Authentication Successful?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 172,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Display Authentication Error",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Record the failed login attempt in the operation history\n- Do not reveal whether the user ID or the password was incorrect",
      "note": {
        "dx": 210,
        "dy": -90,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 232,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Display Main Menu",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF",
      "details": "- Menu items: Issue, Discontinue, Update Information, Search\n- Show only the menu items permitted for the user's role",
      "note": {
        "dx": 555,
        "dy": -60,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 292,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Select Operation",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 352,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Issue New Part Number?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 412,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Discontinue Part Number?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 472,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Update Part Information?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 412,
      "w": 135,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Input Part Attributes",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Required: Part Type, Feature/Material, Part Name\n- Optional: Specification, Unit, Supplier, Drawing No., Remarks\n- Select Part Type and Feature/Material from the code master (pull-down list)",
      "note": {
        "dx": -285,
        "dy": -105,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 472,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Input Valid?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF",
      "details": "- Check that all required fields are entered\n- Check that the selected codes exist in the code master and are active\n- Check for possible duplicates, such as the same name and specification as an existing part, and warn the user",
      "note": {
        "dx": -285,
        "dy": -15,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 532,
      "w": 165,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Determine Part Type Code and Feature/Material Code",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF",
      "details": "- Part Type code: 4 alphanumeric characters (uppercase A-Z, 0-9), defined in the Part Type master\n- Feature/Material code: 4 alphanumeric characters, defined in the Feature/Material master\n- Only administrators may maintain the code masters",
      "note": {
        "dx": -285,
        "dy": 75,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Generate Sequential Number",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF",
      "details": "- Sequence is managed separately for each Part Type + Feature/Material combination\n- Range: 0001 to 9999, zero-padded to 4 digits\n- Next value = current maximum + 1, obtained under a row lock or DB sequence to prevent duplicate issuance\n- Discontinued numbers are never reused",
      "note": {
        "dx": -285,
        "dy": 165,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 652,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Sequence Number Available?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 435,
      "y": 712,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Display Sequence Exhaustion Error",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Shown when the sequence for this combination has reached 9999\n- Prompt the user to contact an administrator about a new Feature/Material code",
      "note": {
        "dx": -195,
        "dy": 195,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 615,
      "y": 712,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Register Part Information to DB",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Format: XXXX-XXXX-NNNN (12 significant characters, 14 characters including hyphens)\n- Validation regex: ^[A-Z0-9]{4}-[A-Z0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4}$\n- Unique constraint on the part number column\n- Initial status: Active; record the issue date and issuing user\n- Commit number generation and registration in a single transaction\n- Display the issued part number to the user",
      "note": {
        "dx": 75,
        "dy": -240,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 472,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Input Target Part Number and Reason",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Input: Target part number, discontinuation reason (required), successor part number (optional)",
      "note": {
        "dx": 330,
        "dy": -180,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 532,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Retrieve Part Information",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Discontinuation Allowed?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF",
      "details": "- The part number exists\n- The current status is Active\n- The successor part number, if entered, exists and is Active\n- Warn the user if the part is referenced by active BOMs or orders (when linked)",
      "note": {
        "dx": 195,
        "dy": -45,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 930,
      "y": 652,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Display Discontinuation Error",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 652,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Update Status to Discontinued",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Logical deletion only (no physical delete)\n- Record the discontinuation date, reason, successor part number, and operating user\n- Discontinued part numbers remain searchable and are never reissued",
      "note": {
        "dx": 90,
        "dy": 120,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 532,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Input Target Part Number",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Retrieve Part Information",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 652,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Part Exists and Editable?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF",
      "details": "- The part exists and its status is Active\n- Discontinued parts are read-only",
      "note": {
        "dx": 390,
        "dy": 120,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 1305,
      "y": 742,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Display Update Error",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 697,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Edit Part Information",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Editable: Part Name, Specification, Unit, Supplier, Drawing No., Remarks\n- Not editable: the part number itself, Part Type, and Feature/Material\n- If the Part Type or Feature/Material changes, discontinue this number and issue a new one (intelligent numbering rule)",
      "note": {
        "dx": 255,
        "dy": 240,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 757,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Input Valid?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 817,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Update Part Information in DB",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Use optimistic locking (version number or last-updated timestamp) to detect concurrent updates\n- Keep before and after values for the history record\n- Record the update date and updating user",
      "note": {
        "dx": 90,
        "dy": 120,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 1425,
      "y": 532,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Input Search Conditions",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Conditions: Part number (prefix or partial match), Part Type, Feature/Material, Part Name (partial match), Status, Issue date range, Supplier\n- Multiple conditions are combined with AND",
      "note": {
        "dx": 60,
        "dy": -210,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 1425,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Execute Attribute Search",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF",
      "details": "- Search by code segment using indexed segment columns (Part Type, Feature/Material)\n- Limit the number of results and apply paging (e.g., 100 per page)",
      "note": {
        "dx": 165,
        "dy": -120,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 1425,
      "y": 652,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Display Search Results",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Show a list with a link to detail view\n- The detail view includes the change history\n- Allow CSV export",
      "note": {
        "dx": 165,
        "dy": -30,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "io",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 892,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Record Operation History",
      "shape_type": "io",
      "fill_color": "#F1FAEE",
      "details": "- Recorded for all operations, including failures and searches\n- Items: Timestamp, User ID, Operation type (Issue, Discontinue, Update, Search, Login), Target part number, Before and after values, Result (success or error), Client information\n- The history table is append-only; no updates or deletions are allowed\n- Writes to the history are made in the same transaction as the business data update",
      "note": {
        "dx": 225,
        "dy": 45,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "decision",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 952,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Continue Operation?",
      "shape_type": "decision",
      "fill_color": "#FDECEF"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "type": "process",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 1012,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "Logout",
      "shape_type": "corner_rounded_rectangle",
      "fill_color": "#EAFBFF",
      "details": "- End the session\n- Automatically log out after 30 minutes of inactivity",
      "note": {
        "dx": -210,
        "dy": 15,
        "display_state": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "type": "terminator",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 1072,
      "w": 120,
      "h": 45,
      "text": "End",
      "shape_type": "normal",
      "fill_color": "#e0e0e0"
    }
